@StudentFleaMarket.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5033

GET {{StudentFleaMarket.API_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Presign upload ảnh tin đăng (chỉ chủ tin)
POST {{StudentFleaMarket.API_HostAddress}}/api/Items/sell/replace-with-item-id/images/presign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "files": [
    {
      "fileName": "textbook-cover.jpg",
      "contentType": "image/jpeg",
      "sizeBytes": 1048576
    }
  ]
}

### Xác nhận ảnh đã upload -> lưu vào ItemImage
POST {{StudentFleaMarket.API_HostAddress}}/api/Items/sell/replace-with-item-id/images/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "objectKeys": [
    "raw/users/replace-with-user-id/items/replace-with-item-id/replace-with-upload-id.jpg"
  ]
}
